{
  "uid": "car-repair-shop-tempo-status",
  "title": "Oficina — Tempo até cada status",
  "tags": [
    "car-repair-shop",
    "negocio"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "O que este painel mede",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Tempo decorrido **desde a abertura da OS** até ela atingir cada status — e não o tempo de permanência em cada um.\n\nA entidade carrega `createdAt`, então este é o intervalo que dá para medir com honestidade: o prazo de cada etapa como o cliente o percebe. Para aproximar a permanência num status, subtraia o percentil do status anterior.\n\nOs buckets vão de 1 minuto a 1 dia — a escala de uma oficina, não a de uma requisição HTTP. Com seis buckets, os percentis são aproximações grosseiras; a tabela de média é mais confiável para volumes pequenos."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p50 — mediana do tempo até o status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, to_status) (rate(service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_bucket[1h])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{to_status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 — cauda do tempo até o status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, to_status) (rate(service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_bucket[1h])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{to_status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Média por status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (to_status) (rate(service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_sum[1h])) / sum by (to_status) (rate(service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_count[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "to_status": "Status",
              "Value": "Média"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Transições registradas por status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (to_status) (service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_count)",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{to_status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "xTickLabelRotation": -30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Distribuição do tempo até o status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(service_orders_time_to_status_seconds_bucket[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges"
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
